title: $:/mf/gen/CLI command/mf log prune before
catalog: CLI command
target: mf log prune before
summary: Delete every operation older than <target> (kept)

!! Reference

```
Delete every operation older than <target> (kept)

Usage: mf log prune before [OPTIONS] [TARGET]

Arguments:
  [TARGET]
          A label id: the label is kept whole, its children included

Options:
      --id <ID>
          Target operation by id

      --timestamp <TIMESTAMP>
          Most recent operation written at or before T (ISO-8601, or @<unix-ms>)

      --force
          Skip the confirmation prompt

      --silent
          Suppress informational output

  -h, --help
          Print help
```
